+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+This project has no recorded decision on a version numbering scheme. No ADR, RFC, decision log, or policy document addressing versioning exists in this repository; the `vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH`-style identifiers seen in `version.go` and `CHANGELOG.md` reflect informal, de facto usage rather than a documented decision.
